# The IMR accepts a request that is ready for them. Run package-encoder.cdp
# first, so both signed copies are in.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | verify_imr
type #login-password | Verify-scratch-pass!
click button[type=submit] | 
wait Requests
click .nav-item | Requests
wait Waiting for your decision
click .series-row | VRF 1.01
wait Your decision
type #imr-comments | In order; the concurrence record is complete.
type #imr-password | Verify-scratch-pass!
click button | Accept
wait Accepted
text .page-subtitle
shot 25-accepted
click .link-btn | Requests
wait Nothing is waiting for you
shot 26-queue-empty
errors
